{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33931","headline":"扬州看辛夷花 · 皮日休","name":"扬州看辛夷花","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"腊前千朵亚芳丛，细腻偏胜素柰功。\n螓首不言披晓雪，麝脐无主任春风。\n一枝拂地成瑶圃，数树参庭是蘂宫。\n应爲当时天女服，至今犹未放全红。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33931.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33931","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}